--[[
	Naoya Zenin - Projection Sorcery (Delta / client-side)
	- Custom animations applied on execute (and on respawn)
	- Toggle button: accelerate, blue prediction frames, drift, dust trail
	- Stray too far from the frames -> you freeze inside a glass frame
	  (with a "photo" of you on it) + 30s lockout. The glass shatters when it ends.

	v3 changes:
	- More forgiving: bigger error tolerance and a bigger freeze threshold
	- Fewer prediction frames, placed closer to you, so they snap in
	  front of you instead of racing ahead
	- Hit a wall at speed: a pink box with a yellow outline closes in on it,
	  faster each hit, until the wall breaks into pieces. Screen flashes pink
	  three times. Bigger walls take more hits, small ones break faster.
	  Broken pieces fade out and the wall fades back in 4 seconds later.
]]

